 r-qn3fzs r-3pj75a r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1habvwh r-18u37iz r-9aw3ui r-17s6mgv r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-z32n2g r-1fuqb1j r-1ssbvtb r-zmhzs6 r-11f147o r-3pj75a"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-16dba41 r-imh66m r-1kt6imw r-dnmrzs" style="color: rgb(231, 233, 234);"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: block;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1x3r274 r-p1pxzi" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">i did see it but we need to add a real hero image the dev sent it . but also i  need the new raffles site and ending soon to be linked to real raffles.. so lets say if we hae useres and they open a new raffle and its public new users can see it under that new raffles and existing raffles that are about to end will be shown in the other page.. will that be possible ?</span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-16lk18l r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1wbh5a2 r-11niif6 r-bnwqim r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-nhe8su r-yn5ncy r-clrlgt r-1niwhzg r-jusfrs r-1udh08x r-q8lnzb"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: none;"></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-3pj75a"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-rjixqe r-16dba41 r-imh66m" style="color: rgb(231, 233, 234);"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: block;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Yes. The home page can read the real raffles. A new active raffle shows under New raffles. One with less time left shows under Ending soon. Each row can open that raffle.</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">The hero image has to be uploaded first. On GitHub, open </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">whitelist-raffle-website</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">, click </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-b88u0q r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Add file → Upload files</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">, and upload the image the developer sent. Name it </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">hero.png</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">.</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvut