r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">so now we need a way to link the new raffles and ending soon to display on the landing page is that possible ?</span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-16lk18l r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1wbh5a2 r-11niif6 r-bnwqim r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1ion2gp r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-1d2f490 r-jusfrs r-u8s1d r-ipm5af r-1mamxrd" style="opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto;"><button role="button" class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-13awgt0 r-18u37iz r-9aw3ui r-1loqt21 r-1ny4l3l" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true" class="r-4qtqp9 r-yyyyoo r-1xvli5t r-dnmrzs r-bnwqim r-lrvibr r-m6rgpd r-homxoj"><g><path d="M8.75 9.414l-.3-.501-.283.17v.33h.583zm-3.5 0h.583v-.331l-.284-.17-.299.5zM10.5 5.25c0 1.429-.85 2.947-2.05 3.663l.6 1.001c1.56-.932 2.617-2.835 2.617-4.664H10.5zM7 2.333c1.027 0 1.91.284 2.522.776.6.481.978 1.188.978 2.141h1.167c0-1.302-.536-2.345-1.415-3.05C9.388 1.504 8.23 1.166 7 1.166v1.166zM3.5 5.25c0-.953.379-1.66.978-2.14.613-.493 1.495-.777 2.522-.777V1.167c-1.229 0-2.388.338-3.253 1.032-.878.706-1.414 1.749-1.414 3.051H3.5zm2.05 3.663C4.35 8.197 3.5 6.679 3.5 5.25H2.333c0 1.829 1.057 3.732 2.618 4.665l.598-1.002zm.283 2.462V9.414H4.667v1.961h1.166zm.292.292c-.161 0-.292-.13-.292-.292H4.667c0 .805.653 1.458 1.458 1.458v-1.166zm1.75 0h-1.75v1.166h1.75v-1.166zm.292-.292c0 .161-.13.292-.292.292v1.166c.805 0 1.458-.653 1.458-1.458H8.167zm0-1.961v1.961h1.166V9.414H8.167z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5.25 9.333h3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.167"></path><path d="M7 9.333V7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-width="1.167"></path></g></svg><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1g4g62n r-clrlgt r-1ldzwu0 r-6dt33c r-bnwqim r-7xmw5f"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-a023e6 r-rjixqe r-16dba41 r-homxoj"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Thoughts</span></div></div></button></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-nhe8su r-yn5ncy r-clrlgt r-1niwhzg r-jusfrs r-1udh08x r-q8lnzb r-1v1z2uz"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: none;"></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-3pj75a"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-rjixqe r-16dba41 r-imh66m" style="color: rgb(231, 233, 234);"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: block;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">The last landing page already does that. I’ll check whether the live site is receiving raffles.Yes, and it is already linked. The boxes are empty because every saved raffle is ended or cancelled. The page only shows raffles with status </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">active</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">.</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">I checked the live data. </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">RAFFLE-0012</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"> through </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">RAFFLE-0001</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"> are all ended. There is nothing for New raffles or Ending soon to display, so the headings appear with no names.</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Create one new raffle and leave it running. After you refresh the home page, its name should show in both boxes. Clicking the name opens </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">raffle.html?id=RAFFLE-0013</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">. When it ends, it drops off both lists.</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1x3r274 r-p1pxzi" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">The connection is already there. It does not need another code change until you want ended raffles to stay visible.</span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-1cmwbt1 r-1wzrnnt r-11niif6 r-3o4zer r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1oszu61 r-18u37iz r-1w6e6rj r-1cmwbt1 r-1h0z5md"><button role="button" class="css-g5y9jx r-sdzlij r-1phboty r-rs99b7 r-lrvibr r-6koalj r-faml9v r-2dysd3 r-1g4g62n r-clrlgt r-6dt33c r-2yi16 r-1qi8awa r-3pj75a r-1loqt21 r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l" type="button" style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border-color: rgb(51, 54, 57);"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-q4m81j r-a023e6 r-rjixqe r-b88u0q r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-16y2uox r-bcqeeo r-1777fci" style="color: rgb(239, 243, 244);"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-dnmrzs r-1udh08x r-1udbk01 r-3s2u2q r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-a023e6 r-rjixqe"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-1cmwbt1"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5 r-18u37iz r-1q142lx r-1w6e6rj r-1777fci r-1udh08x" style="height: 24px;"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1adg3ll r-bztko3" data-testid="UserAvatar-Container-unknown" style="width: 24px; height: 24px; z-index: 2;"><div class="r-1adg3ll r-13qz1uu" style="padding-bottom: 100%;"></div><div class="r-1p0dtai r-1pi2tsx r-1d2f490 r-u8s1d r-ipm5af r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1adg3ll r-1pi2tsx r-13qz1uu r-45ll9u r-u8s1d r-1v2oles r-176fswd r-bztko3"><div class="r-1adg3ll r-13qz1uu" style="padding-bottom: 100%;"></div><div class="r-1p0dtai r-1pi2tsx r-1d2f490 r-u8s1d r-ipm5af r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5 r-sdzlij r-1udh08x r-5f1w11 r-u8s1d r-8jfcpp" style="width: calc(100% + 4px); height: calc(100% + 4px);"><div aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" tabindex="-1" class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5 r-1pi2tsx r-13qz1uu r-1ny4l3l" style="backgro