"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Then open </span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-dyfej2 r-z2wwpe r-15gepa6 r-1471scf r-1aiqnjv r-1hq4qhi r-16dba41 r-ilng1c r-trst2h r-1noe1sz r-njp1lv"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">style.css</span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"> and add this at the bottom:</span></span></span></span><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1adg3ll r-ag158w r-dnmrzs r-1yx7oqi r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-dnmrzs r-1adg3ll r-13qz1uu" data-testid="markdown-code-block"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-1fkb3t2 r-1fs5b29 r-1idry7j r-6413gk r-43g30s r-l4nmg1 r-1u658rm r-2dysd3 r-vmopo1 r-13qz1uu r-gtdqiz r-1fhadnw r-184en5c"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-1aiqnjv r-n6v787"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">css</span></span><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-z5qs1h r-17s6mgv"><button aria-label="Copy to clipboard" role="button" class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5 r-sdzlij r-1phboty r-rs99b7 r-lrvibr r-1ceczpf r-lp5zef r-1loqt21 r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l" type="button" style="border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-q4m81j r-b88u0q r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-16y2uox r-bcqeeo r-1777fci" style="color: rgb(239, 243, 244);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="r-4qtqp9 r-yyyyoo r-dnmrzs r-bnwqim r-lrvibr r-m6rgpd r-10ptun7 r-1janqcz" style="color: rgb(239, 243, 244);"><g><path d="M19.5 2C20.88 2 22 3.12 22 4.5v11c0 1.21-.86 2.22-2 2.45V4.5c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5H6.05c.23-1.14 1.24-2 2.45-2h11zm-4 4C16.88 6 18 7.12 18 8.5v11c0 1.38-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5h-11C3.12 22 2 20.88 2 19.5v-11C2 7.12 3.12 6 4.5 6h11zM4 19.5c0 .28.22.5.5.5h11c.28 0 .5-.22.5-.5v-11c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5h-11c-.28 0-.5.22-.5.5v11z"></path></g></svg><div cl